Error [E0110]: the right side of `||` must be Bool (true or false), but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/or_value_no_comparison.jet:3:20
    |
  3 |     x :: (ready || 5)
    |                    ^
 Why: each side of a logic operator must be a yes/no comparison
 Fix: write the full comparison, e.g. `x == 2`
